Cell id="p3c218" style="html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=8;strokeColor=#37474F;strokeWidth=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="745.0" y="4310.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="52.1" y="4310.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p3c219" value="Who may act: rooms (GET) and GET session check only the ICPDP_OFFICER role. Schedule checks the assigned officer&lt;br&gt;(Open EVENT_PROPOSAL task, else 403). Cancel, respond-reschedule, start, end and no-show also need the session's lead&lt;br&gt;officer (403). Notes check the role only and need an IN_PROGRESS session. The post-defense decision needs the task&lt;br&gt;held by the officer (else 409 &quot;event proposal cannot be decided&quot;). Re-defense -&gt; Re-defense Pending with a new task;&lt;br&gt;scheduling again (step 73) returns the event to Under Review." style="shape=note;size=10;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;fontColor=#263238;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120.0" y="4322.0" width="1080.0" height="82.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
